    ],
    "text": "My No. : 03/f\u00ca/95/t\u00c9v\u00ed/152. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: 3/3/1/7/6. It is hereby declared that Correction Paper in Order Nos. 206 and 207 of 2008 under Proviso (a) to Section 38 in Page 1A of the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1619/23 dated 17.09.2009 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka has been erroneously published. Therefore, by virtue of Section 18 of the Interpretation Ordinance (Chapter 12) as amended by the Interpretation (Amendment) Act No. 18 of 1972 and Intepretation (Amendment) Act No. 29 of 1974, I hereby revoke Order Nos. 206 and 207 of 2008 under Proviso (a) to Section 38 in Page 1A of the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1619/23 dated 17.09.2009 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. K. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.",
